# Head Wind (battlefield.head_wind#exit): inside area 1 the exit NPCs _082 (event 32003, update option 1, finish option
# 0), _084 (32003, finish option 0) and _086 (32003, finish option 4: 0x075 cleared, no position change in the trace)
# each answer 32003; then a warp to the entrance, and _081 triggers the menu 32000 again.
lists BoneyardGully/_081/onTrigger BoneyardGully/_082/onTrigger BoneyardGully/_084/onTrigger BoneyardGully/_086/onTrigger BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32000 BoneyardGully/onEventUpdate/32003 BoneyardGully/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=BoneyardGully pos=-617.9,-1.5,505.7 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
missionstatus Cop 7 pos=4               # a GM
trigger _081
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _082
update 32003 option=1
finish option=0
trigger _084
finish option=0
trigger _086
finish option=4
warp -617.9,-1.5,505.7 BoneyardGully
trigger _081
